 href=\"https://plus.espn.com/mlbtv\">All MLB out-of-market Games. Live or On Demand. All in One Place.</a></h2><p></p></li></ul> <!-- close content --></article><article class=\"sub-module editorial\"><header class=\"\"><h2 class=\"\">Sounding Off</h2></header><ul class=\"content\"><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure video \" data-source=\"espn\" data-contributing-partner=\"wsc\" data-video=\"watch,640,360,49614925\" data-cerebro-id=\"6a7fe477305cdd436b72f4eb\"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:4\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/video/clip/_/id/49614925/what-adjustments-do-tua-falcons-offense-need-make\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://espnmedia-cdn.akamaized.net/espn/media/common/2026/0815/ss_20260815_000059125_3624223/ss_20260815_000059125_3624223.jpg, https://espnmedia-cdn.akamaized.net/espn/media/common/2026/0815/ss_20260815_000059125_3624223/ss_20260815_000059125_3624223.jpg 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 375px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://espnmedia-cdn.akamaized.net/espn/media/common/2026/0815/ss_20260815_000059125_3624223/ss_20260815_000059125_3624223.jpg, https://espnmedia-cdn.akamaized.net/espn/media/common/2026/0815/ss_20260815_000059125_3624223/ss_20260815_000059125_3624223.jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 376px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://espnmedia-cdn.akamaized.net/espn/media/common/2026/0815/ss_20260815_000059125_3624223/ss_20260815_000059125_3624223.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a><span class=\"video-play-button \" data-playTxt=\"PLAY\" data-id=\"49614925\"></span><span class=\"video-length\">0:41</span></div></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"49614925\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:video:49614925:4\" href=\"/video/clip/_/id/49614925/what-adjustments-do-tua-falcons-offense-need-make\">What adjustments do Tua, Falcons offense need to make?</a></h2></li></ul> <!-- close content --></article><article class=\"sub-module editorial\"><header class=\"\"><h2 class=\"\">Trending Now</h2></header><ul class=\"content\"><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure \"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:5\" href=\"/mlb/story/_/id/49603685/mlb-lockout-strike-work-stoppage-lessons-learned-kurkjian\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0811%2Fr1700455_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=center, https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0811%2Fr1700455_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=156&h=156&scale=crop&cquality=40&location=center 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 413px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0811%2Fr1700455_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=272&h=153&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin, https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0811%2Fr1700455_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=544&h=306&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin&format=jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 414px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0811/r1700455_1296x729_16-9.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a></div><span class=\"credit\">V.J. Lovero /Sports Illustrated via Getty Images</span></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"49603685\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:story:49603685:5\" href=\"/mlb/story/_/id/49603685/mlb-lockout-strike-work-stoppage-lessons-learned-kurkjian\">MLB labor: Five lessons learned from the 1994 MLB strike</a></h2><p>As another lockout looms, what lessons can we take from Major League Baseball's last prolonged work stoppage?</p></li><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure \"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:6\" href=\"/college-football/story/_/id/49574597/2026-138-fbs-college-football-teams-tiers-rankings\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0810%2Fr1699949_608x342_16%2D9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=center, https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0810%2Fr1699949_608x342_16%2D9.jpg&w=156&h=156&scale=crop&cquality=40&location=center 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 413px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0810%2Fr1699949_608x342_16%2D9.jpg&w=272&h=153&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin, https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0810%2Fr1699949_608x342_16%2D9.jpg&w=544&h=306&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin&format=jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 414px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0810/r1699949_608x342_16-9.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a></div><span class=\"credit\">Javier Gallegos/The Advocate via AP</span></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"49574597\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:story:49574597:6\" href=\"/college-football/story/_/id/49574597/2026-138-fbs-college-football-teams-tiers-rankings\">Ranking all 138 FBS teams in tiers: Who rises to the top?</a></h2><p>Presenting a tiered ranking of all 138 FBS teams ahead of the 2026 season.</p></li><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure \"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:7\" href=\"/nfl/story/_/id/49521144/2026-ranking-best-nfl-quarterbacks-top-10-trait-skill-arm-accuracy-rushing\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a4.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0809%2Fnfl_orlovsky%27s_qb_trait_rankings_16x9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=center, https://a4.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0809%2Fnfl_orlovsky%27s_qb_trait_rankings_16x9.jpg&w=156&h=156&scale=crop&cquality=40&location=center 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 413px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://a4.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0809%2Fnfl_orlovsky%27s_qb_trait_rankings_16x9.jpg&w=272&h=153&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin, https://a4.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0809%2Fnfl_orlovsky%27s_qb_trait_rankings_16x9.jpg&w=544&h=306&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin&format=jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 414px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0809/nfl_orlovsky's_qb_trait_rankings_16x9.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a></div><span class=\"credit\">ESPN</span></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"49521144\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:story:49521144:7\" href=\"/nfl/story/_/id/49521144/2026-ranking-best-nfl-quarterbacks-top-10-trait-skill-arm-accuracy-rushing\">Ranking NFL quarterbacks by trait: Best arm, accuracy, more</a></h2><p>Does Josh Allen have the league's strongest arm? Is Lamar Jackson still the most unstoppable QB rusher? And where does Caleb Williams stand among the best improvisers?</p></li><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure \"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:8\" href=\"/nba/story/_/id/49593121/russell-westbrook-retires-nba-legacy-triple-double-records-durant-partnership\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0812%2Fr1700952_2_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=center, https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0812%2Fr1700952_2_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=156&h=156&scale=crop&cquality=40&location=center 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 413px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0812%2Fr1700952_2_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=272&h=153&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin, https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0812%2Fr1700952_2_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=544&h=306&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin&format=jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 414px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0812/r1700952_2_1296x729_16-9.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a></div><span class=\"credit\">Photo by Joe Murphy/NBAE via Getty Images</span></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"49593121\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:story:49593121:8\" href=\"/nba/story/_/id/49593121/russell-westbrook-retires-nba-legacy-triple-double-records-durant-partnership\">Russell Westbrook retires: His NBA legacy after 18 electric seasons</a></h2><p>Westbrook revived the triple-double, but what is his true legacy? ESPN NBA insiders examine a thrilling, tireless and polarizing Hall of Fame career.</p></li><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure \"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:9\" href=\"/nfl/story/_/id/49554282/2026-nfl-rookies-spent-their-first-paychecks-money-cash-nil\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0810%2Fnfl_rookie%2Dspending_16x9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=center, https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0810%2Fnfl_rookie%2Dspending_16x9.jpg&w=156&h=156&scale=crop&cquality=40&location=center 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 413px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0810%2Fnfl_rookie%2Dspending_16x9.jpg&w=272&h=153&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin, https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0810%2Fnfl_rookie%2Dspending_16x9.jpg&w=544&h=306&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin&format=jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 414px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0810/nfl_rookie-spending_16x9.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a></div><span class=\"credit\">Illustration by ESPN</span></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"49554282\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:story:49554282:9\" href=\"/nfl/story/_/id/49554282/2026-nfl-rookies-spent-thei